{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHODUNNIT </strong>is a comedic mystery visual novel following a man who must answer a burning question: <strong>who the hell did he hook up with last night?</strong><br><br>Conduct investigations through point-and-click mechanics, interrogate a large cast of characters, and cobble together theories as &quot;regular guy&quot; Howie Falk chases down the ghost of his own gay virginity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INVESTIGATE THE SCENE OF THE CRIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/e186247b5a994d32d214586accfb3e07.poster.avif?t=1768509020\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/e186247b5a994d32d214586accfb3e07.webm?t=1768509020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/e186247b5a994d32d214586accfb3e07.mp4?t=1768509020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine hand-drawn environments to learn topics and clues \u2014 and discover\u00a0multitudes of interactions that react to what you've learnt, who you've talked to, and what has happened in your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEAD THE CONVERSATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/d366fae0e966d2cb330da51a1818e583.poster.avif?t=1768509020\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/d366fae0e966d2cb330da51a1818e583.webm?t=1768509020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/d366fae0e966d2cb330da51a1818e583.mp4?t=1768509020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a wide cast of characters and prompt them with what Howie has learned\u00a0\u2014 break down their walls, get a little too nosy, and maybe also get a little too wrapped up in their problems along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PITCH YOUR THEORIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/0ad0ebb71a1796ca1002e14e6b703e19.poster.avif?t=1768509020\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/0ad0ebb71a1796ca1002e14e6b703e19.webm?t=1768509020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/0ad0ebb71a1796ca1002e14e6b703e19.mp4?t=1768509020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one here is actually a movie detective. Direct critical group conversations and propose permutations of theories to find the truth everyone can agree on... hopefully without also making a mess of it.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A MESSY, STRANGE MYSTERY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of twists and turns with dialogue and events that are reactive to Howie's journey</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully original, jazzy and fun soundtrack\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn environments with animated elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish, kinetic menus and screens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quality of life features like line pinning, line rollback, dialogue history, and plenty of room for saves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/f9fbcab311eed19870ccddbfeef1e528.poster.avif?t=1768509020\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/f9fbcab311eed19870ccddbfeef1e528.webm?t=1768509020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/f9fbcab311eed19870ccddbfeef1e528.mp4?t=1768509020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like what you see, please wishlist the game here on Steam! This way you will get the latest updates as we gear up for the final release. Thank you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3851280?t=1768509020","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/8fa9c9bbcb27e3d8c3a80d517762be6c0790b28a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768509020","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/ec2f0586b8f7aa97d01712869f252e8e79d7a367/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768509020","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/ec2f0586b8f7aa97d01712869f252e8e79d7a367/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768509020","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The main storyline deals with the topic of sex and alcohol use, with no explicit or graphic content in the game itself."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4322950,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>EPISODE ONE &quot;HITTING SINGLES&quot; OUT NOW</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/7d8d111860dda0fcfbbe6729a6e5a044.webp?t=1768509020\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/7d8d111860dda0fcfbbe6729a6e5a044.poster.avif?t=1768509020\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1069 height=296 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play episode one, &quot;Hitting Singles&quot; in our official Steam demo!</strong></h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHODUNNIT </strong>is a comedic mystery visual novel following a man who must answer a burning question: <strong>who the hell did he hook up with last night?</strong><br><br>Conduct investigations through point-and-click mechanics, interrogate a large cast of characters, and cobble together theories as &quot;regular guy&quot; Howie Falk chases down the ghost of his own gay virginity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INVESTIGATE THE SCENE OF THE CRIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/e186247b5a994d32d214586accfb3e07.poster.avif?t=1768509020\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/e186247b5a994d32d214586accfb3e07.webm?t=1768509020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/e186247b5a994d32d214586accfb3e07.mp4?t=1768509020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine hand-drawn environments to learn topics and clues \u2014 and discover\u00a0multitudes of interactions that react to what you've learnt, who you've talked to, and what has happened in your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEAD THE CONVERSATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/d366fae0e966d2cb330da51a1818e583.poster.avif?t=1768509020\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/d366fae0e966d2cb330da51a1818e583.webm?t=1768509020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/d366fae0e966d2cb330da51a1818e583.mp4?t=1768509020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a wide cast of characters and prompt them with what Howie has learned\u00a0\u2014 break down their walls, get a little too nosy, and maybe also get a little too wrapped up in their problems along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PITCH YOUR THEORIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/0ad0ebb71a1796ca1002e14e6b703e19.poster.avif?t=1768509020\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/0ad0ebb71a1796ca1002e14e6b703e19.webm?t=1768509020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/0ad0ebb71a1796ca1002e14e6b703e19.mp4?t=1768509020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one here is actually a movie detective. Direct critical group conversations and propose permutations of theories to find the truth everyone can agree on... hopefully without also making a mess of it.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A MESSY, STRANGE MYSTERY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of twists and turns with dialogue and events that are reactive to Howie's journey</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully original, jazzy and fun soundtrack\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn environments with animated elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish, kinetic menus and screens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quality of life features like line pinning, line rollback, dialogue history, and plenty of room for saves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/f9fbcab311eed19870ccddbfeef1e528.poster.avif?t=1768509020\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/f9fbcab311eed19870ccddbfeef1e528.webm?t=1768509020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/f9fbcab311eed19870ccddbfeef1e528.mp4?t=1768509020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like what you see, please wishlist the game here on Steam! This way you will get the latest updates as we gear up for the final release. Thank you!</p>","developers":["Don Attico"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/46f78ec5e5aab444eaf3ab3dbb5a656d37d61004/header.jpg?t=1768509020","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul cl